         measured: G_cos/G_N = -(alpha_c - 2)/2; <delta K>_k = 0
         reading:  removes Audren+2015's effect (i) at its root; residual lambda-effects on horizon-scale perturbations (O(c_2 (aH/k)^2)) are not computed here -- a construction, not a derivation

